        "html_path": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14227801/observations/step-t6303-45592f8a62b91013da79.html",
        "screenshot": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14227801/observations/step-t6303-45592f8a62b91013da79.png",
        "worked_solution": "",
        "can_dont_know": false,
        "can_skip": false,
        "tutorial": {
          "dom_id": "step-t6303",
          "name": "Introduction",
          "problem": "Let's consider the curve $r = 1+\\cos\\theta$ for $0\\leq \\theta < 2\\pi,$ shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14227801/assets/e72d6a7d4b490a37f99723d0cde12a378f038b43ba373547e9c8feaf71952717.png)\n\nUsing previously discussed techniques, it's straightforward to show that at point $C$ where $\\theta = \\pi,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d y}{\\textrm d x} = \\dfrac{y'(\\theta)}{x'(\\theta)} = \\dfrac00.\n$$\n\nTo see what's happening at this point, let's zoom in and observe the behavior of the curve.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14227801/assets/d03ca27e8cecd32aebc0e6914ac2ab128bce57ab876b96e8aaa91b562041ba4c.png)\n\nIf we look carefully, we notice that the tangent lines flatten out as we approach the point $C$ from either direction.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14227801/assets/4fda95ed912c83ac36ec772b6afa6554ad8a81b7c98a330fd774d501b4bbecdf.png)\n\nTherefore, as we take the *limit* of the tangent lines as we approach $C,$ it would appear that they become horizontal. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14227801/assets/50f8bd688c55d8458a9db100469cd62138efc200402496d3adb18f90ea53e747.png)\n\nWhen the limit of the tangent lines becomes horizontal like this, we say that the curve has a horizontal tangent at $C.$",
          "worked_solution": "",
          "calculator_instructions": "",
          "fields": [],
          "problem_field_keys": [],
          "answer_fields_complete": null,
          "result": null,
          "proof_feedback": null,
          "html": "<div id=\"step-t6303\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\">\n    \n               \n                <div class=\"tutorial\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Introduction</span></div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"t6303\">?</div>\n                    </div>                    \n    \n                    <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>Let's consider the curve <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"12.739ex\" height=\"2.343ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.505ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 5484.7 1008.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">r = 1+\\cos\\theta</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMATHI-72\" d=\"M21 287Q22 290 23 295T28 317T38 348T53 381T73 411T99 433T132 442Q161 442 183 430T214 408