iptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo></mrow></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nSince the limits of our derivative are both infinite, there is a vertical tangent to the curve at <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"152\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D703 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle space=\"4\"><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-145010-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-145010-e-0\"></div>\n\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III.\"</p>\n</div></div>",
