=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> In fact, it is a vertical tangent.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-143555-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-143555-e-0\"></div>\n\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"</p>\n</div></div>",
